NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000833 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000834 "# combine"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000835 "#"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000836 "#  Object method returning success or failure. The given arguments are"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000837 "#  combined into a single comma-separated value. Failure can be the"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000838 "#  result of no arguments or an argument containing an invalid character."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000839 "#  side-effects include:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000840 "#      setting status ()"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000841 "#      setting fields ()"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000842 "#      setting string ()"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000843 "#      setting error_input ()"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000844 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000845 "sub combine {"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000846 "    my $self = shift;"
