NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000852 "    } # combine"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000853 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000854 "# parse"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000855 "#"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000856 "#  Object method returning success or failure. The given argument is"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000857 "#  expected to be a valid comma-separated value. Failure can be the"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000858 "#  result of no arguments or an argument containing an invalid sequence"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000859 "#  of characters. Side-effects include:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000860 "#      setting status ()"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000861 "#      setting fields ()"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000862 "#      setting meta_info ()"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000863 "#      setting string ()"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000864 "#      setting error_input ()"
